#### From selected bond pairs to planar polygons


We finish the length-square estimate for planar polygons modulo lattice translations: $$\label{c7:eq-Pol}
 \sum_{\lambda:\,\operatorname{diam}\lambda\le H}
 x^{|\lambda|}|\lambda|^2\le H^{2/3+o(1)}.$$

